passage('G1.seed-ratios','supplement',[750,757],['S9'],'Epsilon=Lh^2 removes h from the two ratios, and the polynomial face/rank factors cost only CL.',['cap_seed_single_ratio','cap_seed_pair_ratio','cap_single_ratio_log_le','cap_pair_ratio_log_le'],'The exact ratios are m*r/(kappa*L*sqrt L) andm^2*sqrt r/(kappa*L). Kappa>=1,m=2p,1<=r<=p,L=log(ep)>=1 give upper positive logarithms4L and6L. For the dimension-cap proof the actual square factor setsr=p, which satisfies the same conditions and requires no rank surrogate assumption.')
